Z||000006||Raydar||06-14-2001||04:07 PM||||ThatRickGuy,<P>Did you pay for the original work with a credit card? <BR>If so, call the credit card company and explain the situation. Dispute the charges. I think you have 30 (maybe more) days to protest, from the time the charge hits your statement.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"||||reg||1
